      "content": "it's more than just a difficult chapter though. it's like the person who lived in this body is actually dead. i'm just a collection of limbs and pain now. without the sport, without the ability to move like i was meant to... what's even left? it feels like there's no point in maintaining a vessel that has no purpose left to serve.",
